1
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,980
=Weekend Crush=

2
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,280
(Final confession)

3
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,200
So I want to ask you

4
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,680
