5
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,880
Whenever you need me,

6
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,640
just look up, and you'll see me.

7
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,200
Will you be my girlfriend?

8
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,640
Can I be the one who stays

9
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,040
by your side through life?

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,320
Liang Renfang,

11
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,520
would you like

12
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,880
to be my girlfriend

13
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:50,440
and face the world together?

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,600
I would.

15
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,400
I will.

16
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:56,280
I do.

17
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:58,840
Yes.

18
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:02,120
I hope we can have

19
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:03,160
a bright future together.

20
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,440
I hope I'll be part of your future too.

21
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:20,940
(The house journey has ended,
but the romantic story continues)

22
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:23,380
(Daily life after leaving the house)

23
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:25,000
(Mapo tofu)

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,480
Mapo tofu is my absolute favorite.

25
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:29,280
(Making soup)
Where else would you find a guy like him?

26
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,880
My mom thinks so too.

27
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:33,040
She said Yu Yang is a really good guy.

28
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,920
Even your mom said so?

29
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,600
I'm so touched.

30
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,360
Now it's more

31
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,280
about living life together.

32
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:42,000
She's still able to open up to me

33
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,920
so openly and honestly.

34
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,520
I'm heading over
to watch Fang's rehearsal.

35
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,000
(Going to visit Liang Renfang at work)
I'm excited and looking forward to it.

36
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Come on.

37
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,800
Look who we have here.

38
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,560
I just took my hair down.

39
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,960
Really?

40
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,640
You look like
you straight-up time-traveled.

41
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,840
I look like a lion right now.

42
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:06,560
(Liang Renfang rehearsing)
She looks amazing on stage.

43
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:10,000
Good times are always fleeting.

44
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,400
I have a business trip tomorrow,

45
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,880
