46
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:15,640
You're leaving.

47
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:19,640
(Airport send-off)

48
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,920
Off I go.

49
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:24,340
(Their respective days)
Satay Noodles.

50
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,960
Let's check out the drummer's spot.

51
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:28,960
(Their respective days)

52
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,080
When Yu Yang is away on business,

53
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,400
