57
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,560
And when we're around,

58
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,600
we see each other every single day.

59
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,480
Yeah.

60
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,280
(See each other every day)
Every single day.

61
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,880
Because my office is super close

62
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:44,800
