She's asleep.

68
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,080
Hello everyone.

69
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,560
This is my boyfriend, Sun Bohan.

70
00:02:58,640 --> 00:02:59,640
Hello everyone.

71
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:02,400
This is my girlfriend, Xing.

72
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,080
Back in the house,

73
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,440
