77
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,640
and I feel a lot happier.

78
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,240
Our personalities

79
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,480
just feel

80
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,240
naturally compatible.

81
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,320
We're understanding of each other.

82
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,520
We handle

83
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,400
