89
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:32,000
Yeah.

90
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,720
It doesn't want you to pet it.

91
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:36,960
It likes you.

92
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,560
(Learning horse riding together)
In our everyday life,

93
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,040
