94
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,200
every single day.

95
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:43,080
(Taking funny photos together)

96
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,640
Look how round my face is.

97
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,440
Mine is round too.

98
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,960
It's so clingy, isn't it?

99
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,800
(Walking in the park together)

100
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,080
