101
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,600
Pretty much the same.

102
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,920
Didn't you say you're a puppy?

103
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,600
You're a little celebrity today.

104
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:55,760
A big celebrity.

105
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,440
What about you?

106
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,560
I'm your personal assistant.

107
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,880
(Xing's personal assistant)
You're a male celebrity.

108
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:01,160
(Hiking together)
I'm so lucky to have met Xing.

109
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,840
I'm so grateful

110
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,480
that he came into my life.

111
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:05,840
I want to walk through life

112
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,640
