113
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,800
I want to take care of you always.

114
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,320
How did we run into them?

115
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,600
The two of us are total opposites,

116
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,000
