like we're in a debate match.

117
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,280
He's copying me.

118
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,600
He's so done for.

119
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,400
I'm really sorry about that.

120
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,600
Actually, there are plenty of moments

121
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,640
where I feel like

122
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:27,760
she relies on me

123
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:28,400
a bit more.

124
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,840
So pretty. Si put on

125
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,000
