132
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,800
I know you best.

133
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,440
(Know you best)

134
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,800
It's definitely
because I just mentioned it.

135
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,360
I'm a huge fan of yours.

136
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:49,640
I don't buy it.

137
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,800
