141
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,080
He said he guessed it right.

142
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,880
Guessing what the next song would be.

143
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,520
So what's the song after that?

144
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,520
If he's not busy,

145
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,800
