150
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,800
Come in the morning
and go back at night.

151
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,800
All under an hour.

152
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,040
Attached at the hip.

153
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:18,640
Hi.

154
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:22,160
Eating beef.

155
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,960
Hi.

156
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:24,920
