157
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,800
Stand up straight.

158
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,200
I really like having him
by my side all the time.

159
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,080
It gives me such a sense of security.

160
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,360
She's a bit clingy.

161
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,880
Everyone thinks I'm clingy.

162
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:40,200
We talk about what's really
on our minds a lot more,

163
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:43,120
