Buy another one.

169
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:52,680
You want both?

170
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,880
Bought a whole lot of groceries.

171
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:56,400
(Loaded with goodies)

172
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,400
We cook together a lot.

173
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,400
Well, mostly he cooks,

174
