I'm opening this one.

183
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,040
(Suitcase gifted by Cao Yiheng)
A suitcase.

184
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,200
I love this so much.

185
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,440
I'm using it tomorrow.

186
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:22,360
