206
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,440
Heading home.

207
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,520
Hello everyone.

208
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,280
I came out for dinner with Meng today.

209
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,560
Hi.

210
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,760
We've arrived at the amusement park.

211
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,800
Yeah.

212
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,560
Let's eat.

213
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,240
Yeah.

214
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:23,020
