after life in the house ended)

218
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:41,360
(Liang Renfang & Yu Yang have arrived,
"Sparkle")

219
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,280
One of the rare daytime moments

220
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,280
