226
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,680
I'm wearing blue.

227
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,000
Have a seat.

228
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:07,640
Please, take a seat.

229
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,480
