275
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,000
How many times did you two meet up?

276
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,640
We've been
on video calls the whole time.

277
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,840
On video calls.

278
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,120
We went out for karaoke.

279
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:41,360
Cao Yiheng's area of expertise.

280
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:46,840
